                                    <p class="volunteer-details__text">

                                        The Nepali Roots Summit is an annual gathering of Nepali migrant professionals
                                        in Germany,
                                        primarily hosted in Munich. Our goal is to create a strong, supportive network
                                        where knowledge,
                                        experiences, and opportunities are shared to empower the Nepali diaspora.
                                        Through inspiring
                                        talks, workshops, panel discussions, and interactive sessions, we aim to foster
                                        collaboration, career
                                        growth, and community development.

                                    </p><!-- /.volunteer-details__text -->

                                    <p class="volunteer-details__text">

                                        This one-day summit will feature distinguished Nepali professionals from diverse
                                        fields,
                                        each sharing their expertise in short presentations followed by engaging
                                        discussions.
                                        Alongside thought-provoking sessions, the event will include professional
                                        networking
                                        opportunities, workshops and ideas sharing to connect like-minded individuals.


                                        The summit offers valuable insights, professional connections, and a platform to
                                        celebrate
                                        Nepali talent in Germany. We aim to build a useful & impactful Nepali
                                        professional
                                        community, where <b> ideas meet action, and community meets opportunity! </b>
                                    </p>
                                    <p class="volunteer-details__text">


                                        <b>
                                            Together, let's shape a vibrant and impactful future for Nepali
                                            professionals in Germany.
                                        </b>

                                    </p>
                                    <p class="volunteer-details__text">
                                        <i>
                                            Note: Diaspora refers to communities of people living outside their country
                                            of origin while maintaining cultural ties.
                                        </i>
                                    </p>

                                    <p class="volunteer-details__text">
                                        <i>
